AB  - Nuclear disaster risk has been strengthened and enlarged obviously under climate change.So,the conception of nuclear disaster's legislation must be changed from mitigating disaster to mitigating disaster risk,the integrity of procedure must be tamped into site choice of nuclear power,compensation of development right must be added into rules of no residences area and limited zone planning,programming of disaster reduction must be consisted of rounded system and blended into mainstream,the polycentric disaster risk management at the international level must be established and coordination and interaction of"unit triplet,third class"at the domestic level must be expanded.
