AB  - Ningxia is an inland province highly affected by climate change,also highly vulnerable to climate change and suffered with severe poverty problem. The locale people has developed a lot of effective measures to adapt to climate change,which is received much attention from international community. The adaptation practices developed in Ningxia include population relocation,diverting water resources from the Yellow River to the region suffered with drought and water shortage,raising up the water price,improving the cropping system,rehabilitating the ecosystem,and developing the renewable energy for the poor. The implementation of those practices have testified that the poverty has been effectively reduced and the adaptation ability has been effectively improved. To meet the challenge to adaptation to climate change in future,the local government not only pays much attention to adaptation and but also to mitigation in order to greatly reduce the carbon emission intensity,and incorporates the adaptation,and mitigation into the social-economic strategy.Ningxia has set up the leading group for adaptation to climate change and worked out a series of adaptation strategy and action schemes.It is predicted that a new adaptation situation to climate change must be achieved in future with the implementation of those adaptation strategy and action schemes in Ningxia.
