AB  - Climate poverty is a new type of poverty caused by climate change. Climate poverty relates to vulnerability,so it makes the climate poverty be the most difficult poverty to address. Due to the particularity of climate poverty,it needs the mitigation and adaptation to tackle climate poverty. Mitigation needs the concerted effort for global cooperation to make the global protocol for positive carbon emission reduction. It must consider the justice between global and national. Adaptation policies focus on the action between local and nation. It needs the action of the local government to improve its climate adaptation capacity and carry out the climate adaptation policy. It is necessary to make the evaluation index system of the impacts about the climate change on poverty. It needs to play the function of civil society to resist climate poverty. To address climate poverty,we can make it involved into the intrinsic policy for alleviation poverty,and it can make the interaction between the new problem and the old policy.
