AB  - Adapting to climate change in urban areas has been a vital part of climate change strategy in our country. Summarizing the international advanced experience also has reference signification to the cities' adaptation plan in China. From the aspect of system, planning and measures, the paper summarizes the experiences of adapting to climate change of London, Rotterdam and Vancouver. City climate adaption strategy's successful factors mainly include: radiating the leadership of the government in adaptation strategies' governance; setting up a trans-regional and trans-department coordination institution; promoting the climate change awareness of stakeholders; adopting adaption actions and strategies adaptable to local conditions; tracking and evaluating the adaption strategy continuously. Combining with the reality of our country, in the end, the paper summarizes enlightenment to our country's cities in starting work on adaption actions and puts forward relevant suggestions.
