AB  - Agriculture is a fragile production system affected by climate change. The content of agricultural adaptation to climate change and governance is an important issue in the field of climate change, these include the analysis of the formation mechanism of agricultural vulnerability, explore the mechanism of reducing the vulnerability of the system, and enhance the ability to respond to climate change risks. The problem of the impact of climate change on agriculture involves multi subject crossing problem, and it is a system of natural science and social science. This study on the vulnerability governance of agricultural climate has been a process of direct evaluation from a single natural science field to the integration of natural sciences and social sciences. In addition to the government's direct incentive policy or restraint mechanism, Change the mode of government led, mobilize the rural micro subject and community organization resources will become the inevitable choice of agricultural vulnerability management.
