AB  - As an industry influenced greatly by the climate change,adaptation to climate change is especially important to forestry.Mitigation and adaptation are two aspects of addressing the climate change.Although in 2001,IPCC brought out the idea of adaptation in the Third Assessment Report,the research and practice of adaptation to climate change are slower than those of mitigation.However,the impact of climate change is becoming more and more obvious.Therefore,adaptation are receiving more and more attention.The article analyzed systematically the research progress from the perspectives of forest ecological system management,space or land use management,and improving livelihood and eliminating property in communities.Then the outlook of further research on forestry's adaptation to climate change was proposed.
