AB  - Why does the problem of poor nomads' acclimatation in plural participation and governance encounter bottleneck? Governance subject and multi-dimension of resource emphasized in current studies can not give answer to the problem. Based on the field investigation against the snow disaster happened in Yushu in early 2019, the paper carried out the case study on the problem of poor nomads' acclimatation by using holistic governance theory. The study found that multiple subject participation and governance has active meaning on retarding the influence of snow disaster, but the integration degree of relevant subjects, capital,information and aims. The fragmentization problem of governing is remarkable, and the acclimatation problem has not been solved yet. For this reason, to strengthen the common goal, coordinate multiple subjects and use integrated preipo capital for coping with climate risks, just like snow disaster, only in this way can radically satisfy the multidimensional demands and realize the final object of improving the public interest.
