KW  - system
AB  - Under the background of climate change, China's modern agricultural development is lacking an effective science and technology communication system, which is manifested in the communication of the advanced concept and technology of agriculture adapting to climate change. The communication is restricted by the prominent "disseminator-based" idea to spread to the rural vulnerable groups; by the narrow channels of communication to be accurately and timely disseminated; by the poor scientific literacy of farmers to be recognized and accepted; by the limitation of communication content to be actively and continuously updated;and by the difficulty of combined "science and education promotion" to achieve good effect. Therefore, we constructed the "five W hierarchical and hierarchical interactive scientific communication system model",namely "modern agricultural science and technology communicator system", "modern agricultural science and technology information system", "modern agricultural science and technology media system", "modern agricultural science and technology receiver system", and "modern agricultural science and technology effect system" under the background of climate change. This system model could adapt not only to climate change,but also to the development trend of modern agriculture.
