AB  - In new era of ecological civilization construction,space planning is the foundation of core decision-making and control for implementation of the integration of urban and rural development planning and governance,and an important way to reduce disaster risk (DRR) and adapt to climate change (CCA).As a rapidly urbanizing country with high social vulnerability,Indonesia has mature experience in the planning practice of DRR and CCA.The paper reviews the specific practices of space planning of DRR and CCA in Indonesia in terms of system composition,development process of the strategy and planning,relevant laws and regulations,and then attempts to provide useful enlightenment on the development of security and the prevention and reduction of disaster from the perspective of the reconstruction of China's territorial space system.According to the excellent experience of space planning methods and strategies of DRR and CCA in Indonesia,the paper puts forward suggestions for territorial space planning in China as follows:(1)integrating DRR and CCA into the construction of territorial space planning system and policy formulation;(2)strengthening the prevention and control of disaster risks under the perspective of the integration of urban and rural planning;(3)developing appropriate integration tools and technologies of DRR and CCA;(4)establishing a sharing platform of knowledge and information;(5)creating opportunities for local governments self-organization;(6)emphasizing on disaster education.
